+- **Corpus harness** -- a historical cohort of **34,908 KiCad operating-point fixtures**; [input freezing](docs/kicad-experiment.md) now records declaration identities and separate planned rescues. Reproducible, repaired comparison results are pending. Minimal operating-point fixtures do not certify transient, AC, or noise behavior.
 
